# Campaign short link on the forms domain.
/try    /try-inspection-forms/    302

# kitchenchecklists.com is a domain alias on this project, and everything on it goes to the Kitchen Line
# Walk demo - that is the only form carrying the demo instructions and the hidden alert-phone field.
#
# Netlify passes the query string through on a 301 automatically, which is the whole reason the domain was
# moved here: GoDaddy's parked-domain forwarding stripped ?phone=, so the lead's number never reached the
# form and the over-temp demo text could never fire. Do not "simplify" this back to registrar forwarding.
#
# Both schemes are listed because http and https need separate rules, and the ! forces the rule even when
# a real file would otherwise match the path.
http://kitchenchecklists.com/*    https://forms.inspectionreadykitchens.com/kitchen-line-walk/    301!
https://kitchenchecklists.com/*   https://forms.inspectionreadykitchens.com/kitchen-line-walk/    301!
